      "image": "assets/images/230103/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place green beans into a large skillet and cover with water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until beans just start to soften, 3 to 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-bJEdCGyO9NUxMwRPMUXhjACIqM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Step2_ButteryGarlicGreenBeans__9932-ff8861dc27e14e96937713205ab60ea8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230103/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain and return to the skillet. Add butter and stir until melted, 1 to 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/umbyLFQBhGMQSEWUdyYwzWlgqWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/Step3_ButteryGarlicGreenBeans__9942-e80d4b3677624692acdf2170a36d4584.jpg"
